Paper 4 impact: Paper 4 TLT regime caveat survives: residualized NFCI is genuinely independent of VIX+MOVE during rate-hike regime. K1120 conclusion intact. Caveat: a substantial fraction of K1120's raw NFCI signal comes from the VIX-correlated component of NFCI; the truly orthogonal TLT-specific component is the smaller residual portion. Paper 4 should explicitly note that ~71% of NFCI variance overlaps with VIX+MOVE.
